  "status_text": "Even with NOT gates allowed, one family of graphs keeps demanding more gates as it grows. Checked in Lean, on one-a-side inputs: every fan-in-two AND/OR/NOT circuit for the complement of the N by N matching, row u joined to every column but u, has at least 2N gates, from N = 3 [L-meta-17187]. Its size-5 case, no such circuit of at most 9 gates, is checked too, from our own proof [L-meta-17200].",
